# =====================================================================
# PUBHLT 0411 — Python half
# Public repo: teaching content only.
# Planning documents, the syllabus, and authoring references stay local.
# =====================================================================

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: planning and internal documents ---
HANDOFF_*.md
PREPUBLISH_CHECKLIST.md
shared/
*.docx
~$*.docx
github-pages-setup.txt

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: local tooling config ---
.claude/

# --- The student Python environment ---
# .venv is per-machine and must never be committed.
# student/uv.lock MUST be committed — it is what pins every student to
# identical package versions. It is listed here only to say: do not add it.
.venv/
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Rendering student/*.md produces HTML that would otherwise be swept into the
# zip — README_INSTRUCTOR.html especially, which carries the build commands.
# The .md files are the deliverable; nothing renders them for students.
student/*.html
student/*_files/

# --- Build outputs ---
# student/ is the source of the distribution and IS tracked. The zip built
# from it is not — rebuild with the command in student/README_INSTRUCTOR.md.
python.zip
pubhlt0411.zip
# A `python/` folder at the repo root is a scratch extraction of that zip, not
# a source. student/ is authoritative; edits made in a copy do not reach it.
/python/

# --- Autograding, work in progress ---
# Contains SOLUTIONS-*.qmd, which the *_solutions.ipynb rule below does not
# match. The repo is public — never track this.
autograding/
# LaTeX intermediates from rendering a deck to PDF. The .html is the
# deliverable; these are regenerated on every render.
*.aux
*.vrb
*.log
*.snm
*.nav
*.toc
module*/class/*.pdf
# student/data/ is a COPY of the root data/ made at packaging time.
student/data/
# Likewise a COPY, of module0/lab/module0_lab.ipynb. It ships in the zip root
# because students run it next to data/; the master lives with the other labs.
student/module0_lab.ipynb

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: superseded drafts of the landing page ---
index_backup_*.qmd

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: lab solutions ---
# The repo is public and the site is served from it. moduleN_lab.ipynb (the
# empty student copy) IS published; the solutions copy must never be.
# Regenerate both with `python3 tools/make_notebooks.py`.
*_solutions.ipynb

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: per-module build documentation ---
# Instructor-facing: file manifests, render commands, design rationale,
# verification notes. Students reach modules only through index.qmd.
module*/README.md

# --- NOT PUBLISHED: authoring references and superseded work ---
# Consolidated into _archive/ on 2026-08-23; see _archive/README.md for what
# is in there and what was deleted outright.
_archive/
tools/

# --- Build artifacts (regenerated by `quarto render`) ---
.quarto/
_site/
site_libs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
.ipynb_checkpoints/
